{"4278470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unburden", "steam_appid": 4278470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/0363efc4ae035075c775137ca37d47d9.poster.avif?t=1781124224\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/0363efc4ae035075c775137ca37d47d9.webm?t=1781124224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/0363efc4ae035075c775137ca37d47d9.mp4?t=1781124224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark worked for it. He put in the time. Everything he thought he wanted he has, but now Mark is stuck. The weight is something he's never clearly understood until now, and there just has to be more to life. He must lighten the load. It's time to unburden.   <br> <br>In this casual, single player, adventure game you guide Mark on his journey. Using things from his collection of &quot;<i>meaningful</i>&quot; items, Mark helps the new friends he meets with their various <i>problems</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/920b8a1c876780c1bc6c6f739e255757.avif?t=1781124224\" width=932 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, Mark makes some friends, picks up new skills, learns to let go of the past, and discovers what is truly important. <i>Hint: it's not stuff.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/a136faca1100d48992077f869082ac6c.poster.avif?t=1781124224\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/a136faca1100d48992077f869082ac6c.webm?t=1781124224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/a136faca1100d48992077f869082ac6c.mp4?t=1781124224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark's efforts change his world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up some skills (C'mon, you've always wanted to juggle.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Puzzles that'll make you feel smart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good vibes for all</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/0363efc4ae035075c775137ca37d47d9.poster.avif?t=1781124224\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/0363efc4ae035075c775137ca37d47d9.webm?t=1781124224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/0363efc4ae035075c775137ca37d47d9.mp4?t=1781124224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark worked for it. He put in the time. Everything he thought he wanted he has, but now Mark is stuck. The weight is something he's never clearly understood until now, and there just has to be more to life. He must lighten the load. It's time to unburden.   <br> <br>In this casual, single player, adventure game you guide Mark on his journey. Using things from his collection of &quot;<i>meaningful</i>&quot; items, Mark helps the new friends he meets with their various <i>problems</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/920b8a1c876780c1bc6c6f739e255757.avif?t=1781124224\" width=932 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, Mark makes some friends, picks up new skills, learns to let go of the past, and discovers what is truly important. <i>Hint: it's not stuff.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/a136faca1100d48992077f869082ac6c.poster.avif?t=1781124224\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/a136faca1100d48992077f869082ac6c.webm?t=1781124224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/extras/a136faca1100d48992077f869082ac6c.mp4?t=1781124224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark's efforts change his world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up some skills (C'mon, you've always wanted to juggle.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Puzzles that'll make you feel smart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good vibes for all</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "UNBURDEN is a casual, adventure game in which you guide Mark on a journey to shed his heavy burden of precious possessions while helping others he meets along the way. All in an effort to restore the vibrancy and lightness life once held.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4278470/83d74cd515a63fb2c6e481280956c375db79ba96/header.jpg?t=1781124224", "c